<title>BOLIVIA: SOCCER-PERU BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-PERU BEAT URUGUAY 1-0 IN COPA AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>SUCRE, Bolivia 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peru beat Uruguay 1-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a Copa America first round group B match</p>
<p>Thursday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Martin Hidalgo (74th minute)</p>
<p>Attendance: 5,000</p>
</text>
